{"sections":[{"slug":"无穷小景","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"无穷小景"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">无穷小景</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“无穷小景”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于开集</span>\n$$\r\nU\\hookrightarrow X\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">考虑无穷小嵌入</span> $U\\hookrightarrow T$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $\\mathcal O_U = \\mathcal O_T\\big/ \\text{幂零元}$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">于是</span> $D$ <span lang=\"zh\">模可视为</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{QCoh}(X_{\\text{inf}}) = D\\mathsf{-Mod}(X).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span>: "},{"Local":{"url":"/deRham空间","text":"de Rham <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}